{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124133908759-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124141507\"/><p>慈雲山道有學生被Tesla撞傷倒地。</p><p>慈雲山發生交通意外。今午(24日)12時40分，一輛Tesla電動車駛經慈雲山道近一中學對開時，撞倒一名男學生。男生倒地受傷，途人見狀上前協助。傷者清醒由救護車送院救治，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.607672+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:39:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:17.475762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:26.540308+00:00","content_hash":"b027a43a0ff6b9a0e45fbecb5bb6eb51515337ef39b65487fe891a334f0cb471","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.607672+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}